{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u300eThe Sushi House\u300f</i>is a first-person, story-driven game set in an ordinary sushi restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the midst of familiar routines and a quiet atmosphere, a subtle sense of unease begins to creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/Trailergameplaycut23.gif?t=1748413577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Part-Time Job Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start your new part-time job at the sushi house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A co-worker shows you the ropes, and you spend your day preparing sushi,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> cleaning the floor, and managing the shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At first, everything seems normal. But as you go about your daily tasks,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a strange feeling begins to settle in\u2014like something isn\u2019t quite right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And slowly, that feeling draws you deeper into the mystery of the place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687470/extras/Trailergameplaycut24.gif?t=1748413577\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person, immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic sushi-making and shop management systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet, unsettling atmosphere that gradually intensifies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive dialogue and narrative-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short but impactful experience (approximately 1\u20132 hours)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recommended Play Environment</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Headphones or earphones strongly recommended</p></li></ul>","background":"https: